/-!
# Preservation of the explicit ambient exterior space

For each published ambient generator, every one of the 1221 spanning
forms has a kernel-certified pullback and an explicit expansion in the
same span. Finite-dimensional injectivity then gives setwise stabilization
by mem_formStabilizer_of_basis. No local-group or coverage facts are used.

The source data and conventions are in KernelEquations/source/README.md;
the certificate generator is ExteriorInvariance/source/generate.py.
All Python output consists of untrusted witnesses checked in Lean.
-/

@[expose] public section
